# Backport provenance:
# https://github.com/PipeWire/pipewire/commit/f174b4e688346898b7cdf3a45934ab91849d7369
# https://github.com/PipeWire/pipewire/commit/f252ed337f4a84ddd376d1582ad27e1a3f754488
