# The first upstream change establishes safe snapshot withdrawal before a
# forced graph rebuild; the second extends that ordering to teardown.  This
# 1.6.6 backport additionally keeps a live Flush in-place, quiesces the
# callback-owning follower before Suspend teardown, and resets its cycle state.
